particular, those who don't have enough knowledge about kernels and such
shouldn't subscribe to that mailing list since the discussions should be
centered around the developpment effort. On the other hand, I invite
anybody who has the knowledge and the interest in that project to subscribe.

The channel is linuxss and you can subscribe to it by sending a message to
linux-activists-request@niksula.hut.fi with the folowing line in the body:

X-Mn-Admin: join linuxss

If you want more info about the mailing list and the way it works, you
have to send a message with "Help" in the body. (In fact if you send
anything that the mailing list manager can't process, you'll have the same
result.) The mailing list manager will send you back documentation about
the mailing list.

