Anyone who has used the MKS Toolkit (a commercial set of Unix-style tools
for MS-DOS) is likely to have used the _lc_ command as an alternative to
_ls_. I have produced an inproved version of _lc_ which is available for
ftp as indicated in the Linux Software Map entry below.  This is no great
feat of programming but if you find yourself frequently having to look at
the contents of directories then you might as well use the best tool for
the job.
