the file Boot-TransAm-3.5.Z is based on a newer kernel (99 p13) and includes
drivers for Sony CDU31A, Sony 535, better Mitsumi driver in addition to
SCSI and Sound Blaster. We recommend using this disk first.
The reason to use the first one is 1) if memory is tight and 2) if there is
